  "scope": "Pinned public source references. The implementation entries below now adapt selected source components; this document is not a claim of complete Telegram UI or runtime parity.",
  "implementation": [
    "apps/zoen/modules/zoen-core/ios/ZoenAttachmentGalleryContent.swift",
    "apps/zoen/modules/zoen-core/ios/ZoenAttachmentGalleryHost.swift",
    "apps/zoen/modules/zoen-core/ios/ZoenAttachmentMosaicLayout.swift",
    "apps/zoen/modules/zoen-core/ios/ZoenAttachmentGalleryMotion.swift",
    "apps/zoen/modules/zoen-core/ios/ZoenAttachmentPhotoEditor.swift",
    "apps/zoen/src/media/attachment-approval.ios.tsx"
  ],
  "selectedLicense": "GPL-3.0 under upstream GPL-2.0-or-later option, combined with Zoen under AGPLv3 section13",
  "adaptations": [
    "The exact upstream MosaicLayout algorithm is namespaced and receives the actual view trait display scale instead of deprecated UIScreen.main.",
    "Legacy gallery and photo-toolbar geometry, selection rail and selected bubble grouping are translated to UIKit under existing Zoen callback owners.",
    "The invoked legacy gallery uses distance128/velocity700 and original JNW sampled spring parameters; this replaces the unrelated modern gallery viewport/4 policy.",
    "GalleryContent is shared between Photos and durable private cache previews; it owns no selection, durable bytes, captions, backend state or delivery.",
    "Explicit full Photos preview allows requested iCloud representation download with cancel/revision guards; thumbnail and neighbor requests remain offline.",
    "A zero-size Expo adapter presents a window sibling, with native retirement, nonterminal child-presentation display leases and scoped callback identity.",
    "The image-editor subset uses original toolbar/crop glyphs, 44-point crop hit regions and actual UIKit/ImageIO/PencilKit rendering; only crop, quarter-turn rotation, ink, ink undo and explicit Save are enabled. PNG bytes enter the existing canonical media capture/CAS path without a new temp file owner.",
    "Photo and durable review use the same native gallery; final native caption text is journaled before Send or Edit, with selection/account/context revalidation after the CAS write.",
    "Paging and reorder have separate interaction revisions. Stale paging snaps to the authoritative item; Send/Edit require the displayed page to match the authorized preview."
  ],
  "remaining": [
    "Whole upstream GPU/filter, sticker, text, advanced paint and image-edit undo engines are not ported.",
    "Movie scrubber/trim/editor UI is not ported; existing video editing remains Quick Look.",
    "Integrated Release Simulator proof covers whole-image preview, nonterminal selection, caption focus/back, image rotation/save and category handoff. Software-keyboard timing, image interruption, real iCloud, memory, accessibility, rotation and canonical recovery are not fully qualified.",
    "The source transition host/container snapshot and decoded-image crossfade are UIKit adaptations and require pixel/animation comparison; no pixel-perfect parity is claimed."
  ]
}
